.TH KAGI-VOLUME-ATTACH 1 "September 2026" "Kagi 0.38.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kagi-volume-attach \- attach a Kagi block volume to a Linux host
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kagi-volume-attach
[ARGS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Helper for connecting a Kagi NBD-backed volume to a local block device for host or hypervisor use. Consult the script `--help`/source for environment-specific arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
kagi-volume-nbd(1), kagi-volume-qemu-scsi(1)
